        "created_at": "2015-12-26T21:55:54.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>With Villains of the Multiverse right around the corner, I figured I would make a thread about this, because I'm interested in knowing:</p><p>What environments do you like fighting villain teams in or which ones seem more favorable in a team battle?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>My favorite is probaly Dok'Thorath, just because the AoE attacks suddenly become a lot more nuetral instead of more detrimental to the heros</p>",
