        "created_at": "2015-12-27T05:49:52.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The Court of Blood is my favorite.</p><p>I like Omnitron-IV and Freedom Tower a good bit, they really mess with the game.</p><p>Magmaria balances out really well vs. teams, I love Atlantis, but Pillars and Font of power are wicked. &nbsp;The Kraken gets to stay out a lot though.</p>",
